WEBVTT

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:11.450
Marmalade Boy

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.476
Dakedo ki ni naru

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.588
Kinou yori mo zutto...

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:21.221
Togireta yume. ..

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:24.852
Futari no tsuzukiga shiritai!

00:00:31.203 --> 00:00:36.436
Ah, kami—sama...
jikan o... tomete yo

00:00:36.975 --> 00:00:43.039
Kyou kasho...seifuku...
mada kami, kawakanai...

00:00:44.383 --> 00:00:49.844
Ah, tasukete...
ribbon ga kimaranai...

00:00:50.489 --> 00:00:56.621
Aitsu no yume mita sei... yo

00:00:57.529 --> 00:01:01.329
Koge—kake no toast kajitara...

00:01:04.069 --> 00:01:08.870
Naze ka fui ni...
mune ga tokimeita...

00:01:10.709 --> 00:01:15.612
Amakute nigai. . .marmalade

00:01:15.747 --> 00:01:18.181
Dakara ki ni naru...

00:01:18.717 --> 00:01:20.742
Konna kimochi wa naze?

00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:23.983
Ima ichiban...

00:01:25.457 --> 00:01:28.984
Aitsu no egao ni aitai!

00:02:33.625 --> 00:02:41.555
I'M HOME —
"HOW WILL I BE AROUND HIM?"

00:08:46.598 --> 00:08:50.659
HAVE A WONDERFUL MEETING

00:11:26.024 --> 00:11:28.288
MARMALADE BOY

00:11:34.766 --> 00:11:37.394
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:11.335 --> 00:22:12.302
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:33.757 --> 00:22:36.692
NIGHT OF THE MOON
AND STARS — "I'M STILL LONELY...
EVEN WHEN YOU'RE CLOSE."

00:22:53.911 --> 00:22:58.439
Kokoro ga arawareru

00:22:58.582 --> 00:23:03.815
Hikari wo mitsuketa

00:23:03.954 --> 00:23:08.550
Mezamete iku sora ni

00:23:08.692 --> 00:23:14.130
Anata ga kagayaku no

00:23:14.298 --> 00:23:19.201
Donna ni tooku

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:24.330
Hanarete ite mo

00:23:24.475 --> 00:23:29.344
Onnaji yoake wo

00:23:29.480 --> 00:23:34.850
Mukaete iru no ne

00:23:34.985 --> 00:23:39.615
Mabushiku kirameku no

00:23:39.757 --> 00:23:45.059
Omoide wo musubu ito

00:23:45.195 --> 00:23:50.258
Mirai no mirai ni mo

00:23:50.401 --> 00:23:55.429
Kamisama ga itekureru

00:23:55.572 --> 00:24:01.841
Kamisama ga itekureru
